            "sid": "ISA 28:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Give ye ear, and hear my voice; hearken, and hear my speech.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Doth the plowman plow all day to sow? doth he open and break the clods of his ground?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When he hath made plain the face thereof, doth he not cast abroad the fitches, and scatter the cummin, and cast in the principal wheat and the appointed barley and the rie in their place?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For his God doth instruct him to discretion,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.28.26",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.28.26"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "doth teach him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For the fitches are not threshed with a threshing instrument, neither is a cart wheel turned about upon the cummin; but the fitches are beaten out with a staff, and the cummin with a rod.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 28:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bread",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "corn",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.28.28",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.28.28"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "is bruised; because he will not ever be threshing it, nor break",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.28.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.28.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
